---
permalink: /analyses/clusters/
---

{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block title %}Historic Clusters - Analyses - {{ siteConfig.title }}{% endblock %}
{% block description %}K-means clustering of names based on binary vectors of historic top-100 presence across 13 decades{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<article class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
  <div class="mb-6">
    <div class="mb-2">
      <a href="/analyses/" class="text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 text-sm">&larr; All Analyses</a>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900">Historic Clusters</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl">
      Every name with at least one historic top-100 decade is converted into a 13-dimensional binary vector (1 if top 100, 0 otherwise), then grouped into 4 clusters using k-means. Below each cluster shows its centroid (the "average" pattern) and the names assigned to it.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">
      Clustered across {{ historicClusters.total | formatNumber }} names, spanning decades {{ historicClusters.decades[0] }}–{{ historicClusters.decades[historicClusters.decades.length - 1] }}.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
    <span class="font-semibold">Legend:</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-4 h-4 bg-green-600 border border-gray-200"></span>Top 100 in that decade</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-4 h-4 bg-white border border-gray-200"></span>Outside top 100 / unranked</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-4 h-4 bg-green-300 border border-gray-200"></span>Centroid weight (stronger shade = higher share)</span>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-10">
    {% for cluster in historicClusters.clusters %}
    <section class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
      <header class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200 px-4 py-3 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">
          Cluster {{ cluster.index + 1 }}
          <span class="ml-2 text-sm font-normal text-gray-600">({{ cluster.label }})</span>
        </h2>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-600">{{ cluster.count | formatNumber }} names</span>
      </header>

      <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-gray-200 bg-white">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-500 mb-2">Centroid</div>
        <table class="border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              {% for decade in historicClusters.decades %}
              <th class="px-1 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-gray-600">{{ decade }}</th>
              {% endfor %}
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              {% for value in cluster.centroid %}
              <td class="centroid-cell" style="background: rgba(22, 163, 74, {{ value }});" title="{{ historicClusters.decades[loop.index0] }}: {{ (value * 100) | round }}%"></td>
              {% endfor %}
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-white">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-500 mb-2">Members</div>
        {% if cluster.count == 0 %}
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">No names assigned to this cluster.</p>
        {% else %}
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="border-collapse w-full">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="sticky left-0 bg-white text-left px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-r border-gray-200">Name</th>
                {% for decade in historicClusters.decades %}
                <th class="px-1 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-gray-600 border-b border-gray-200">{{ decade }}</th>
                {% endfor %}
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {% for member in cluster.members %}
              <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
                <td class="sticky left-0 bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 px-3 py-1 text-sm whitespace-nowrap border-r border-gray-200">
                  <a href="/names/{{ 'boy' if member.gender == 'Boy' else 'girl' }}/{{ member.uniqueSlug }}/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-medium">{{ member.name }}</a>
                  <span class="ml-1 text-[10px] text-gray-400">{{ 'M' if member.gender == 'Boy' else 'F' }}</span>
                </td>
                {% for bit in member.vector %}
                <td class="heatmap-cell {{ 'bg-green-600' if bit == 1 else 'bg-white' }}"
                    title="{{ member.name }} — {{ historicClusters.decades[loop.index0] }}: {{ 'top 100' if bit == 1 else 'outside top 100' }}"></td>
                {% endfor %}
              </tr>
              {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</article>

<style>
  .heatmap-cell {
    width: 20px;
    min-width: 20px;
    height: 18px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }
  .centroid-cell {
    width: 28px;
    min-width: 28px;
    height: 24px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }
</style>
{% endblock %}
